-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      Exact archive entry and original/NEXLOAD boot, full hidden ROM;
              independent source-pixel and hook registers/R/RAM checks, all 57
              figures and four shifts, deliberately broken builds and native
              player-update/sound comparisons. Emulator evidence only.

  Replay      Original continuous routes and all-zone demo; independent colour
              model and hook registers/R/RAM. Full verification recorded
              separately with source and output hashes.

  Emulator    JNext 1.1.104; NextZXOS v2.10 (26.11); actual-loader acceptance
              recorded separately against this package SHA256.

  Coverage    Opening menus and gameplay; all 57 figure records and four
              shifts. Demo covers 30 zones. Unreached final-ship copy paths
              and collision/timer trainer behaviour have controlled original-
              code tests.

  Hardware    none

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
